  <para style="toc2">Filemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Paulo nɛ a wo lɛ tsu mi ngɛ Yesu Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi he ɔ; kɛ nyɛminyumu Timoteo nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ ya ha Filemon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Wa suɔlɔ kɛ wa huɛ ni tsulɔ, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />kɛ asafo nɛ kpee ngɛ o we ɔ mi, kɛ wa nyɛmiyo Apia, kɛ Arkipo nɛ ji sɛumi tso ɔ he ta hwulɔ kaa ami nitsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo bi yemi kɛ buami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />I naa Mawu si daa ngɛ ye sɔlemi mi ha mo, suɔlɔ Filemon, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ejakaa i nuɔ o suɔmi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ o ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu kɛ e ni ɔmɛ a mi ɔ he; <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />nɛ i kpaa pɛɛ kaa o huɛ ɔmɛ a na o hemi kɛ yemi ɔ eko, akɛnɛ a naa nɔ́ kpakpahi nɛ o na kɛ je Kristo dɛ mi ɔ; konɛ a je mi bami nɛ tsake. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ye nyɛminyumu, ami nitsɛ i na bua jɔmi babauu kɛ je o suɔmi ɔ mi, ejakaa o mi jɔmi ɔ haa Mawu bi ɔmɛ a tsui nɔɔ a mi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8-9" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i suɔ nɛ o pee nɔ́ ko ha mi. I ngɛ he blɔ ngɛ Kristo biɛ mi nɛ i biɔ mo, ejakaa e ji nɔ nɛ sa nɛ o peeɔ, se ngɛ suɔmi nɛ i suɔ mo he je ɔ i ma bi mo. Ami Paulo nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ i bwɔ, se a wo mi tsu mi ngɛ Yesu Kristo he. <verse eid="PHM 1:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o na ye bi Onesimo mɔbɔ, nɔ nɛ i kpɔ kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ be mi nɛ a wo mi tsu mi nɛ i ngɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Onesimo, nɔ nɛ e biɛ ɔ sisi ji “Senami” ɔ, e ji nɔ ko nɛ sa a, e he be se nami ko ha mo, se jehanɛ ɔ e he maa ba se nami babauu ha i kɛ mo tsuo. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />I ngɛ lɛ tsɔe kɛ ma o ngɔ, nɛ o he lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o ma he ami nitsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />I ko suɔ kaa e kɛ mi nɛ hi si ngɛ hiɛ ɔ be mi nɛ i ngɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ mi ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ i fiɛ ɔ he, konɛ o ye kɛ bua mi kɛ gu e nɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Se i be suɔe nɛ ma pee ja ke o kplɛɛ we nɔ. Nɛ akɛnɛ o mi mi jɔ nɛ o peeɔ nɔ́ kpakpa momo he je ɔ, i be suɔe nɛ ma nyɛ o nɔ. Se ma suɔ kaa e je mo nitsɛ o tsui mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Moo ngɔ kaa e tu fo kɛ je o he be bɔɔ kɛkɛ, se jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ e kpale kɛ ba o ngɔ kulaa, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />pi kaa sɔmɔlɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu nɔ nɛ pe sɔmɔlɔ po, suɔlɔ nyɛminyumu nɛ i fiɛ we e he, nɛ e he maa ba se nami kɛ ha mo babauu, ejakaa e ji sɔmɔlɔ kɛ o nyɛmi ngɛ Kristo mi.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Ke o buu mi kaa o huɛ niinɛ ɔ, lɛɛ o he lɛ atuu nɛ o hɛɛ lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ o maa hɛɛ mi ke ami nitsɛ nɛ i ba o ngɔ ɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Nɛ ke e pee mo yayami ko aloo e ju o nɔ́ ko ɔ, moo ngɔ jamɛ a tɔmi ɔ kɛ ha mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />I ma to mo nane mi. Ami Paulo nitsɛ nɛ i ngɛ enɛ ɔ ngmae kɛ ngɛ mo si woe, se i be hiɔ nɛ o hɛɛ mi ɔ nɔ ta tsie. Anɔkuale ɔ ji kaa ami nɛ i ha o plɛ bɔ nɛ o ji nɛ ɔ ngɛ Kristo mi. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Suɔlɔ nyɛminyumu, moo pee enɛ ɔ ha mi nɛ ye tsui maa nɔ ye mi nɛ i ma je Kristo yi kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />I ngɛ mo womi nɛ ɔ ngmae, nɛ i ngɛ nɔ mi mami kaa o maa pee pe nɔ nɛ i bi mo nɛ ɔ po.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o dla he ko kɛ to mi, ejakaa i ngɛ he nɔ kami kaa Mawu maa bu nyɛ pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue, nɛ e be kɛe nɛ e ma ha nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafra nɛ ji ye huɛ nɛ lɛ hu e ngɛ tsu mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ ngɛ Kristo Yesu Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ e fiɛ ɔ he ɔ, ke e biɔ mo. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Marko kɛ Aristarko, Dema kɛ Luka nɛ a ji nihi nɛ i kɛ mɛ tsuɔ ni ɔ, ke mɛ hu a biɔ mo.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ mumi ɔ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>